flowchart LR
    P[Customer, staff or representative] --> N[Layered notice: purpose, business, required or optional]
    N --> C{Required for approved service or separate choice?}
    C -->|Required and lawful| A[Collect minimum necessary data]
    C -->|Optional consent/choice| O{Clear affirmative choice?}
    O -->|No| X[Do not collect or enable]
    O -->|Yes| A
    A --> D[(Authoritative purpose-bound owner data)]
    D --> M[Authorized merchant workflow]
    D --> S[Approved providers/subprocessors]
    D --> R[Minimized projections, devices and telemetry]
    P --> Q[Access, correct, export, restrict, object or delete request]
    Q --> V[Verify identity/authority and responsibility]
    V --> T[Owner and provider tasks with deadlines]
    T --> Z[Outcome, redress and minimal completion evidence]
    O -->|Withdrawal later| T
